    <section id="faq" class="st st-faq-accordion" data-uid="smvrrymdfb4fu">
      <div class="st-wrap">
        <header class="st-head">
          <p class="st-eyebrow" data-anim="item">FAQ</p>
          <h2 class="st-h2" data-anim="item" data-anim-text>Questions? <span class="hl">We’ve got answers</span></h2>
          <p class="st-lead" data-anim="item">Everything you need to know about plans, billing and getting started.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="fq-list" data-accordion="single first">
          <details class="st-acc" data-anim="item">
            <summary class="st-acc-q"><span>Is there a free plan?</span><span class="st-acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="st-acc-a"><p>Yes. The Starter plan is free forever for up to three people, with no credit card required. Upgrade any time when your team grows.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="st-acc" data-anim="item">
            <summary class="st-acc-q"><span>Can I change plans later?</span><span class="st-acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="st-acc-a"><p>Of course. Upgrade or downgrade from your billing settings at any time. Changes apply immediately and we prorate the difference.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="st-acc" data-anim="item">
            <summary class="st-acc-q"><span>How does the free trial work?</span><span class="st-acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="st-acc-a"><p>Paid plans include a 14-day free trial with every feature unlocked. If you don’t add a payment method, your workspace simply moves to the free plan.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="st-acc" data-anim="item">
            <summary class="st-acc-q"><span>Can I import from another tool?</span><span class="st-acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="st-acc-a"><p>Yes. One-click importers bring in projects, tasks and comments from the most popular tools, and a CSV import covers everything else.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="st-acc" data-anim="item">
            <summary class="st-acc-q"><span>Is my data secure?</span><span class="st-acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="st-acc-a"><p>Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest, backed up daily and hosted in SOC 2 certified data centres. Business plans add SSO and audit logs.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="st-acc" data-anim="item">
            <summary class="st-acc-q"><span>Do you offer discounts for non-profits?</span><span class="st-acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="st-acc-a"><p>Yes. Registered non-profits and schools get 50% off any paid plan. Contact us with proof of status to apply.</p></div>
          </details>
        </div>
        <p class="fq-contact" data-anim="item"><span>Still have a question?</span> <a href="mailto:hello@webdevpuneet.com"><span>Talk to our team</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
